### Bug description

When using `SelectMany` on an entity that has an owned entity type in Entity Framework, the query fails with the `System.InvalidOperationException: Table not found with alias 'd'`. The issue occurs when selecting from an entity containing an owned entity type and projecting to an anonymous type inside the `SelectMany` call:

```c#
await context.Set<DocumentTest>()
            .SelectMany(x => x.Versions.Select(y => new { d = x, v = y }))
            .ToListAsync();
```

